    "scope": "Focused peer review of Bash (猛撞) consistency only; fixed-SHA source-block research was not repeated.",
    "findings": [
      "The exact Bash name key loc_trait_bespoke_crit_chance_on_push resolves to two trait variants and four bindings: crowbar_p1_m1 plus ogryn_combatblade_p1_m1/m2/m3; the central config, extension config, map, and generated indexes agree on the two weapons and tier values.",
      "Crowbar I–IV is +5/+7.5/+10/+12.5 percentage points; Ogryn combatblade I–IV is +7.5/+10/+12.5/+15 percentage points. Both wrappers use a 3-second duration; tier overrides replace the wrapper fallback value.",
      "Push qualification is reported as filtered collision targets with a selected push profile and num_hit_units > 0; actual damage or stagger is not required, and weak pushes can qualify. One push action yields one finish event, including when multiple targets qualify.",
      "The push itself is fixed noncritical and the effect begins after push completion; subsequent ordinary, charged, and push-follow-up melee attacks can benefit. Crowbar special toggles and combatblade uppercut sweeps do not trigger Bash; uppercuts can benefit while active.",
      "The chance calculation is clamp, then attack-specific chance-to-damage conversion, then PRD rounding. At a 20% starting pool and no conversion, Crowbar IV gives 32.5% before the roll (33% PRD input), a 62.5% unrounded-pool relative increase; combatblade IV gives 35%, a 75% relative increase.",
      "A 3-second effect triggered at t=0, switched away at t=1, and returned to at t=2 has about 1 second remaining and expires at t=3; the timer continues while unequipped. Repeated valid pushes refresh the timer without adding stacks or cooldown.",
      "The compact “at least one target” weapon summaries are read alongside the detailed trigger paragraph, which defines the qualifying filter/profile condition. The exact name/description RAW keys and locale hashes match; percentage and duration values are statically reconstructed through the trait formatter. The icon ID/path and GitHub attachment are separate fields, and the image receipt reports verified display/hash.",
      "Checked 219 local Markdown links across the eight entry pages, two reverse weapon pages, and two generated indexes; no broken local targets were found. GFM tables and internal entry links are structurally consistent.",
      "RAW 呈現修正：英文模板以 inline code 顯示，將原文尾端的一個空白保留在 code span 內，並明示該空白；只改 Markdown 呈現，RAW 記錄與內容雜湊未變。"
    ],
